mulib provides CMake targets:

    find_package(MuLib CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE MuLib::MuLib)

  With the "qml" feature, QML modules are installed under the package's
  qml/Mu directory (Mu.Material, Mu.Model, and friends). Add it to your
  QML import path, e.g.:

    set(QML_IMPORT_PATH "${VCPKG_INSTALLED_DIR}/${VCPKG_TARGET_TRIPLET}/qml")

  See share/mulib/MuLibTargets.cmake for the targets present in this
  installation.
